<title>POLAND: Exbud signs PLN 44 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud signs PLN 44 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA signed a 44 million zlotys contract with the Polish Powszechny Bank Kredytowy SA (PBK) to expand its Warsaw headquarters, Exbud said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the work had to be completed by March 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
